<main>
<h1>Keal — tests/doc/sample.keal</h1>
<p>Generated by <code>keal doc</code>. Signatures are the compiler's own.</p>
<h2 id="tests-doc-sample-keal-">tests/doc/sample.keal</h2>
<section id="tests-doc-sample-keal-grade">
<pre class="sig">func grade(score: Int): String</pre>
<p>Turns a raw score into a grade label.</p>
<p>Scores below zero are <code>invalid</code>; the scale is the usual one.</p>
</section>
<section id="tests-doc-sample-keal-Measure">
<pre class="sig">record Measure(val value: Float, val unit: String) : Ord</pre>
<p>A measurement with its unit, comparable by magnitude.</p>
<div class="members">
<pre class="sig m">val value: Float</pre>
<pre class="sig m">val unit: String</pre>
<pre class="sig m">func compareTo(other: Measure): Int</pre>
<p>Magnitude order; the unit is a label, not a dimension.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="tests-doc-sample-keal-Reportable">
<pre class="sig">trait Reportable</pre>
<p>Anything that can render itself for a report.</p>
<div class="members">
<pre class="sig m">func report(): String</pre>
<pre class="sig m">func summary(): String  (default)</pre>
<p>A one-line summary, derived from <code>report</code> unless overridden.</p>
</div>
</section>
<footer>keal doc</footer>
</main>
</div>
</body>
